Assets: android/app/src/main/assets/yamnet.tflite
        + android/app/src/main/assets/yamnet_labels.txt
Upstream: Google YAMNet audio event classifier (MobileNet-v1, 521 classes)
Code + weights: https://github.com/tensorflow/models/tree/master/research/audioset/yamnet
License (model code and weights): Apache License, Version 2.0
  (tensorflow/models LICENSE covers /research; includes yamnet.h5 weights).
