License (labels/ontology): the label list derives from the AudioSet ontology,
  which is CC BY-SA 4.0 (dataset CC BY 4.0):
  https://research.google.com/audioset/download.html
  Ontology: https://github.com/audioset/ontology
Attribution (keep with any redistribution):
  "YAMNet by Google (tensorflow/models, Apache-2.0); labels derived from the
  AudioSet ontology by Google, CC BY-SA 4.0."
